2.4: Actions That Don't Respect Extinction

* summon nasties (monster spell)
* statue traps
* stone to fleshing statues
* applying figurines
* create familiar spell
* angry god minion summoning
* demon summoning via hand to hand combat with monsters while
  polymorphed into a demon (not succubus, incubus, or balrog) [will
  summon named demons of your alignment or another of whatever demon
  you currently are]
* specific monsters on special levels

